#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1
msgid "Part XI: Operations and Deployment"
msgstr "第 XI 部分：运维与部署"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:4
msgid ""
"We cover the two surfaces, every command-line flag, the edge load "
"balancer and its clusters, forward-auth recipes, policy files, persistent "
"storage in SQLite or PostgreSQL, clustering over one shared database, and "
"packaging."
msgstr ""
"我们介绍两种形态、每个命令行选项、边缘负载均衡器及其集群、forward-auth 配置方案、策略文件、SQLite 或 PostgreSQL "
"中的持久存储、基于一个共享数据库的集群，以及打包。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:6
msgid "Surfaces and Configuration"
msgstr "形态与配置"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:9
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:172
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2976
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:3175
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:3204
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:3346
msgid "Objectives"
msgstr "学习目标"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:11
msgid ""
"By the end of this chapter, we should be able to run Sibuna as a reverse "
"proxy or a forward-auth validator, choose a surface, set the "
"proof-of-work tier and difficulty, and manage the master secret."
msgstr ""
"学完本章，我们应当能够把 Sibuna 作为反向代理或 forward-auth 验证器运行，选择形态，设置工作量证明的层和难度，并管理主密钥。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:13
msgid "Choosing a Surface"
msgstr "选择形态"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:16
msgid ""
"*Gate* (``--gate``, alias ``--no-waf``): proof-of-work admission, "
"sessions, declarative rules, reputation, GCRA limits, bans."
msgstr ""
"*Gate*\\ （``--gate``，别名 ``--no-waf``）：工作量证明准入、会话、声明式规则、信誉、GCRA 限制、封禁。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:17
msgid ""
"*Shield* (default, ``--shield``, alias ``--waf``): Gate plus the semantic "
"firewall."
msgstr "*Shield*\\ （默认，``--shield``，别名 ``--waf``）：Gate 加上语义防火墙。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:18
msgid ""
"*Distributed deployment* (an option for either surface): ``--data-dir`` "
"keeps policies, reputation and forensics in a local SQLite file; "
"``--database-url`` with ``--cluster-node`` connects several nodes to one "
"PostgreSQL database (SID 0011)."
msgstr ""
"*分布式部署*\\ （两种形态都可选用）：``--data-dir`` 把策略、信誉和取证数据保存在本地 SQLite "
"文件中；``--database-url`` 加上 ``--cluster-node`` 把多个节点连接到同一个 PostgreSQL "
"数据库（SID 0011）。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:20
msgid "Edge mode"
msgstr "边缘模式"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:23
msgid ""
"With ``--config-file`` the daemon runs as an edge load balancer. It "
"forwards TCP and UDP, terminates TLS, HTTP/2 and HTTP/3, and applies the "
"gate or shield to the HTTP names that need it. ``sibuna lb`` starts the "
"same load balancer from a few options, without a file, ``sibuna check "
"-f`` checks a file offline, and ``sibuna ctl`` inspects the daemon and "
"changes its servers while it runs. With an ``authority`` section the "
"topology comes from a database that ``sibuna authority`` publishes to "
"(SID 0028), and with a ``mesh`` section several nodes share their state. "
"``--config-file`` takes none of the options below. The chapter *Edge Load "
"Balancing* below describes the commands and the file."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``--config-file`` 时，守护进程作为边缘负载均衡器运行。它转发 TCP 和 UDP，终止 TLS、HTTP/2 和 "
"HTTP/3，并对需要的 HTTP 名称应用 Gate 或 Shield。``sibuna lb`` "
"只用几个选项、无需文件即可启动同样的负载均衡器，``sibuna check -f`` 离线检查文件，``sibuna ctl`` "
"检查守护进程并在其运行时变更服务器。有 ``authority`` 部分时，拓扑来自 ``sibuna authority`` "
"发布到的数据库（SID 0028）；有 ``mesh`` 部分时，多个节点共享各自的状态。``--config-file`` "
"不接受下面的任何选项。下文 *边缘负载均衡*\\ 一章介绍这些命令和文件。"

