"也互斥。没有 ``--cluster-node`` 的数据库 URL 会被拒绝。Zaxonlite 的集群选项 "
"``--cluster-listen``、``--cluster-peer``、``--cluster-secret-file`` 以及 "
"``--cluster-tls-cert``、``--cluster-tls-key`` 和 ``--cluster-tls-ca`` "
"已被移除；给出其中任何一个都会以 ``RemovedOption`` 终止启动，并附带一条指向 SID 0011 的提示。控制台的选项列在下一章。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:165
msgid "The master secret"
msgstr "主密钥"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:167
msgid ""
"Without ``--secret-file`` or ``SIBUNA_SECRET`` the daemon draws a random "
"seed, and the banner prints \"random (set --secret-file)\". Tokens and "
"challenges then die with the process, and a cluster whose nodes hold "
"different seeds will reject each other's cookies. Generate one with "
"``head -c 32 /dev/urandom | xxd -p -c 64 > /etc/sibuna/secret`` and mode "
"0600."
msgstr ""
"没有 ``--secret-file`` 或 ``SIBUNA_SECRET`` 时，守护进程会生成一个随机种子，启动横幅打印 “random "
"(set --secret-file)”。此时令牌和挑战会随进程一起失效，而节点持有不同种子的集群会相互拒绝对方的 Cookie。用 ``head "
"-c 32 /dev/urandom | xxd -p -c 64 > /etc/sibuna/secret`` 生成一个，并设置权限为 0600。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:169
msgid "Edge Load Balancing"
msgstr "边缘负载均衡"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:174
msgid ""
"By the end of this chapter, we should be able to start a load balancer "
"with one command, write an edge topology in JLV, forward TCP and UDP, "
"terminate TLS with HAProxy-style PEM bundles or with certificates that "
"Sibuna obtains itself, route HTTP by host name and path to HTTP/1.1, "
"HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 servers, turn the firewall on or off per name, limit "
"rates, check server health, drain and add servers while the daemon runs, "
"and reload the file without dropping flows."
msgstr ""
"学完本章，我们应当能够用一条命令启动负载均衡器，用 JLV 编写边缘拓扑，转发 TCP 和 UDP，用 HAProxy 风格的 PEM 证书包或 "
"Sibuna 自行获取的证书终止 TLS，按主机名和路径把 HTTP 路由到 HTTP/1.1、HTTP/2 和 HTTP/3 "
"服务器，按名称开启或关闭防火墙，限制速率，检查服务器健康状态，在守护进程运行时排空和添加服务器，并在不中断流的情况下重新加载文件。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:176
msgid "Starting with one command"
msgstr "用一条命令启动"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:179
msgid ""
"We need no file to balance load. One command serves HTTP on port 8080 and "
"spreads the requests over two servers."
msgstr "均衡负载不需要文件。一条命令就能在端口 8080 上提供 HTTP 服务，并把请求分散到两台服务器上。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:181
msgid "sibuna lb --bind :8080 --server 10.0.0.1:80 --server 10.0.0.2:80"
msgstr "sibuna lb --bind :8080 --server 10.0.0.1:80 --server 10.0.0.2:80"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:185
msgid ""
"``--bind`` and ``--server`` take numeric addresses and may repeat. "
"``:8080`` means every IPv4 address of the host. The firewall is off, so "
"the command is a plain load balancer. The other options are few."
msgstr ""
"``--bind`` 和 ``--server`` 接受数字地址，并且可以重复。``:8080`` 表示主机的每个 IPv4 "
"地址。防火墙处于关闭状态，因此这条命令就是一个普通的负载均衡器。其他选项不多。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:187
msgid "Options of ``sibuna lb``"
msgstr "``sibuna lb`` 的选项"

