"user, so a new process can start before the old one stops. Linux only. "
"Changing it takes a restart."
msgstr "监听器与同一用户的其他 Sibuna 进程共享地址，因此新进程可以在旧进程停止之前启动。仅限 Linux。修改它需要重启。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:365
msgid "``upgrade_socket``"
msgstr "``upgrade_socket``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:367
msgid ""
"The path of the socket over which a new process takes the listeners and "
"the UDP mappings of this one. See \"Replacing the binary without losing a "
"connection\". Linux only. Changing it takes a restart."
msgstr ""
"新进程通过这个套接字接管本进程的监听器和 UDP 映射，这是该套接字的路径。见“不丢失连接地替换二进制文件”一节。仅限 Linux。修改它需要重启。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:369
msgid ""
"One worker thread accepts connections, inspects handshakes and owns the "
"UDP mappings. Established TCP streams move to the relay threads. On Linux "
"every thread waits with epoll, so an idle flow costs no CPU time. We "
"budget two file descriptors for each TCP stream and one for each UDP "
"mapping. The operating system must allow the daemon that many descriptors "
"(``LimitNOFILE`` under systemd)."
msgstr ""
"一个 worker 线程接受连接、检查握手，并拥有 UDP 映射。已建立的 TCP 流转移到中继线程。在 Linux 上，每个线程都用 epoll "
"等待，因此空闲的流不消耗 CPU 时间。我们为每个 TCP 流预留两个文件描述符，为每个 UDP "
"映射预留一个。操作系统必须允许守护进程拥有这么多描述符（systemd 下为 ``LimitNOFILE``）。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:371
msgid ""
"UDP sources are not validated, so a flood of spoofed addresses could fill "
"the table. The separate UDP ceiling keeps TCP and HTTP clients admitted. "
"When the UDP share is full, a new client replaces the oldest mapping that "
"no server has answered."
msgstr ""
"UDP 源地址不经验证，因此大量伪造地址可能会填满这张表。单独的 UDP 上限保证 TCP 和 HTTP 客户端仍能被准入。UDP "
"份额已满时，新客户端会替换掉最老的、尚无服务器应答的映射。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:375
msgid "TLS certificates"
msgstr "TLS 证书"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:378
msgid ""
"An HTTP frontend terminates TLS when it has a ``tls`` object. The ``crt`` "
"key works as it does in HAProxy. Each entry is a PEM file that holds the "
"certificate chain, leaf first, followed by its private key. An entry may "
"also be a directory. We then load every ``*.pem`` file in it, in name "
"order."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 前端有 ``tls`` 对象时会终止 TLS。``crt`` 键的作用与 HAProxy 中相同。每个条目都是一个 PEM "
"文件，其中包含证书链（叶证书在前），后面跟着它的私钥。条目也可以是一个目录。此时我们按名称顺序加载其中的每个 ``*.pem`` 文件。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:380
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"frontends\": {\n"
"    \"web\": {\n"
"      \"proto\": \"http\", \"binds\": [\"0.0.0.0:443\"],\n"
"      \"tls\": {\"crt\": [\"/etc/sibuna/certs/forge.example.org.pem\", "
"\"/etc/sibuna/certs/\"],\n"
"              \"http3\": true},\n"
"      \"default_backend\": \"site\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  },\n"
"  \"backends\": {\"site\": {\"mode\": \"http\", \"servers\": [{\"name\": "
"\"s1\", \"addr\": \"10.20.0.8:8040\"}]}}\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"frontends\": {\n"
"    \"web\": {\n"
"      \"proto\": \"http\", \"binds\": [\"0.0.0.0:443\"],\n"
"      \"tls\": {\"crt\": [\"/etc/sibuna/certs/forge.example.org.pem\", "
"\"/etc/sibuna/certs/\"],\n"
"              \"http3\": true},\n"
"      \"default_backend\": \"site\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  },\n"
"  \"backends\": {\"site\": {\"mode\": \"http\", \"servers\": [{\"name\": "
"\"s1\", \"addr\": \"10.20.0.8:8040\"}]}}\n"
"}"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:394
msgid ""
"We can use the file that HAProxy uses, or build one from separate files."
msgstr "我们可以直接使用 HAProxy 所用的文件，也可以从单独的文件构建一个。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:396
msgid ""
"cat fullchain.pem privkey.pem > /etc/sibuna/certs/forge.example.org.pem\n"
"chmod 600 /etc/sibuna/certs/forge.example.org.pem"
msgstr ""
"cat fullchain.pem privkey.pem > /etc/sibuna/certs/forge.example.org.pem\n"
"chmod 600 /etc/sibuna/certs/forge.example.org.pem"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:401
msgid ""
"The first certificate loaded is the default. The DNS names in each leaf "
"certificate select among the others by the server name of the handshake. "
"An exact name wins over a wildcard such as ``*.example.org``. A handshake "
"that names no certificate receives the default one. With "
"``\"strict_sni\": true`` it is refused instead. We may still give "
"``cert_file`` and ``key_file`` as two separate files. Each file is "
"limited to 256 KiB and a listener to 256 certificates. A key that does "
"not match its certificate fails the check, and the message names the file."
msgstr ""
"加载的第一个证书是默认证书。每个叶证书中的 DNS 名称按握手的服务器名称在其余证书中进行选择。精确名称优先于 ``*.example.org`` "
"这样的通配符。没有指明证书的握手会收到默认证书。设置 ``\"strict_sni\": true`` 时，这样的握手会被拒绝。我们仍然可以把 "
"``cert_file`` 和 ``key_file`` 作为两个单独的文件给出。每个文件限制为 256 KiB，每个监听器限制为 256 "
"个证书。与证书不匹配的密钥无法通过检查，消息中会指出该文件。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:403
msgid ""
"A TLS listener offers ``h2`` and ``http/1.1`` by ALPN. HTTP/1.1 over TLS "
"behaves like the plain listener: keep-alive and WebSocket upgrades work. "
"With ``\"http3\": true`` we also bind the same port on UDP, and HTTP/2 "
"responses advertise it with Alt-Svc. We can test the three protocols with "
"``curl --http1.1``, ``curl --http2`` and ``curl --http3-only``. Challenge "
"cookies issued over TLS carry the Secure attribute."
msgstr ""
"TLS 监听器通过 ALPN 提供 ``h2`` 和 ``http/1.1``。基于 TLS 的 HTTP/1.1 "
"与明文监听器行为相同：keep-alive 和 WebSocket 升级都能工作。设置 ``\"http3\": true`` 时，我们还会在 "
"UDP 上绑定同一个端口，HTTP/2 响应会用 Alt-Svc 通告它。我们可以用 ``curl --http1.1``、``curl "
"--http2`` 和 ``curl --http3-only`` 测试这三种协议。通过 TLS 签发的挑战 Cookie 带有 Secure "
"属性。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:405
msgid "A ``tls`` object takes three more members, all optional."
msgstr "``tls`` 对象还接受三个成员，都是可选的。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:411
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:485
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:599
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:789
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1242
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1368
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1686
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1720
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2117
msgid "Member"
msgstr "成员"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:414
msgid "``min_version``"
msgstr "``min_version``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:415
msgid "``\"1.2\"``"
msgstr "``\"1.2\"``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:416
msgid ""
"The lowest TLS version offered. ``\"1.3\"`` refuses TLS 1.2 clients. "
"HTTP/3 always uses TLS 1.3."
msgstr "提供的最低 TLS 版本。``\"1.3\"`` 拒绝 TLS 1.2 客户端。HTTP/3 总是使用 TLS 1.3。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:417
msgid "``client_ca``"
msgstr "``client_ca``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:419
msgid ""
"A PEM file of CA certificates. A client must then present a certificate "
"that one of them signed."
msgstr "一个包含 CA 证书的 PEM 文件。此时客户端必须出示一个由其中某个 CA 签名的证书。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:420
msgid "``client_auth``"
msgstr "``client_auth``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:421
msgid "``\"required\"``"
msgstr "``\"required\"``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:422
msgid ""
"With ``client_ca``: ``\"optional\"`` also admits a client that presents "
"no certificate. A certificate that is presented must still verify."
msgstr "与 ``client_ca`` 一起使用：``\"optional\"`` 也准入不出示证书的客户端。已出示的证书仍然必须通过验证。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:424
msgid ""
"The cipher suites are those of the TLS library, all with forward secrecy "
"and authenticated encryption, and are not configurable."
msgstr "密码套件是 TLS 库提供的那些，全部具有前向保密和认证加密，不可配置。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:426
msgid ""
"Sibuna offers X25519MLKEM768 for TLS 1.3 on its listeners and outbound "
"HTTP connections, including HTTP/3, origin pools, ACME and the console. "
"The client also sends an X25519 share so a peer that chooses X25519 can "
"finish without a retry. SQLx manages TLS to PostgreSQL separately and "
"uses classical key exchange. SID 0035 measured about 70 additional "
"microseconds per hybrid handshake on the test server."
msgstr ""
"Sibuna 在监听端和出站 HTTP 连接的 TLS 1.3 握手中提供 X25519MLKEM768，适用于 HTTP/3、源站池、ACME "
"和控制台。客户端也发送 X25519 密钥份额，因此对端选择 X25519 时无需重试即可完成握手。SQLx 单独管理到 PostgreSQL 的 "
"TLS 连接，使用经典密钥交换。SID 0035 在测试服务器上测得，每次混合握手约多耗时 70 微秒。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:428
msgid ""
"When a client presents a certificate that verifies, the servers receive "
"its identity in the request field ``X-Client-Cert-SHA256``: the SHA-256 "
"digest of the certificate, in 64 lower-case hexadecimal digits. This is "
"the value that ``openssl x509 -in client.pem -outform DER | sha256sum`` "
"prints. A server keeps a list of the digests it accepts, or maps each "
"digest to an account. Sibuna removes every field of that name from the "
"request of a client, also when it is spelled with ``_``, so a server may "
"trust the field as Sibuna's statement. A request without the field came "
"from a client without a certificate. We do not pass the certificate "
"itself or its subject name yet."
msgstr ""
"当客户端出示的证书通过验证时，服务器会在请求字段 ``X-Client-Cert-SHA256`` 中收到它的身份：证书的 SHA-256 "
"摘要，为 64 个小写十六进制数字。这就是 ``openssl x509 -in client.pem -outform DER | "
"sha256sum`` 打印的值。服务器保存一份它接受的摘要列表，或把每个摘要映射到一个账户。Sibuna "
"会从客户端的请求中删除所有该名称的字段，用 ``_`` 拼写时也是如此，因此服务器可以把这个字段当作 Sibuna "
"的声明来信任。没有该字段的请求来自没有证书的客户端。我们目前还不传递证书本身或它的主体名称。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:430
msgid ""
"To staple an OCSP response we put it as a DER file beside the "
"certificate, with ``.ocsp`` added to the certificate's file name, as "
"HAProxy does. We do not fetch or check the response: the tool that renews "
"the certificate refreshes the file and sends SIGHUP."
msgstr ""
"要装订 OCSP 响应，我们像 HAProxy 那样，把它作为 DER 文件放在证书旁边，文件名为证书文件名加上 "
"``.ocsp``。我们不获取也不检查该响应：续期证书的工具负责刷新这个文件并发送 SIGHUP。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:432
msgid ""
"The next section lets Sibuna obtain and renew certificates itself. An "
"external ACME client such as certbot or acme.sh also fits. Its deploy "
"hook writes the combined PEM file into the ``crt`` directory and sends "
"SIGHUP. For the HTTP-01 challenge we route "
"``/.well-known/acme-challenge/`` to the client's own listener with "
"``\"firewall\": false``."
msgstr ""
"下一节让 Sibuna 自己获取和续期证书。外部 ACME 客户端（例如 certbot 或 acme.sh）也同样适用。它的部署钩子把合并的 "
"PEM 文件写入 ``crt`` 目录并发送 SIGHUP。对于 HTTP-01 挑战，我们用 ``\"firewall\": false`` 把 "
"``/.well-known/acme-challenge/`` 路由到该客户端自己的监听器。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:434
msgid ""
"To rotate a certificate we replace the file and send SIGHUP. A new "
"handshake uses the new certificate. An established session keeps the one "
"it started with. A reload with a bad file changes nothing."
msgstr ""
"要轮换证书，我们替换文件并发送 SIGHUP。新的握手使用新证书。已建立的会话保留它开始时所用的证书。使用有问题的文件重新加载不会改变任何东西。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:438
msgid "Automatic HTTPS"
msgstr "自动 HTTPS"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:441
msgid ""
"We need no certificate file. We list a name under ``auto`` and Sibuna "
"obtains its certificate, serves it, and renews it. A public name gets its "
"certificate from Let's Encrypt. A wildcard does too, through DNS. An "
"internal name or an IP address gets one from an authority that Sibuna "
"keeps itself. This is the whole file for two public names."
msgstr ""
"我们不需要证书文件。我们在 ``auto`` 下列出一个名称，Sibuna 就会获取它的证书、提供该证书并为它续期。公共名称从 Let's "
"Encrypt 获取证书。通配符也一样，通过 DNS 获取。内部名称或 IP 地址从 Sibuna "
"自己维护的证书颁发机构获取证书。下面是两个公共名称的完整文件。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:443
msgid ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return {\n"
"        frontends: {\n"
"            web: { binds: [\"0.0.0.0:443\"], tls: { auto: "
"[\"example.org\", \"www.example.org\"] } },\n"
"            plain: { binds: [\"0.0.0.0:80\"] },\n"
"        },\n"
"        backends: { app: { servers: [\"10.0.0.1:80\", \"10.0.0.2:80\"] } "
"},\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return {\n"
"        frontends: {\n"
"            web: { binds: [\"0.0.0.0:443\"], tls: { auto: "
"[\"example.org\", \"www.example.org\"] } },\n"
"            plain: { binds: [\"0.0.0.0:80\"] },\n"
"        },\n"
"        backends: { app: { servers: [\"10.0.0.1:80\", \"10.0.0.2:80\"] } "
"},\n"
"    }\n"
"}"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:455
msgid ""
"One command does the same without a file. It listens on port 443 and on "
"port 80."
msgstr "一条命令无需文件也能做到同样的事。它监听端口 443 和端口 80。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:457
msgid ""
"sibuna lb --tls auto --domain example.org --domain www.example.org "
"--server 10.0.0.1:80"
msgstr ""
"sibuna lb --tls auto --domain example.org --domain www.example.org "
"--server 10.0.0.1:80"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:461
msgid ""
"The certificate authority speaks the ACME protocol (RFC 8555). It checks "
"that we control each name, and it does so by connecting to us."
msgstr "证书颁发机构使用 ACME 协议（RFC 8555）。它检查我们是否控制每个名称，检查方式是连接到我们。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:464
msgid ""
"The authority fetches the challenge before issuance. Sibuna answers "
"before the firewall and serves the stored certificate on port 443."
msgstr "颁发机构在签发前获取质询。Sibuna 在防火墙检查前应答，并在 443 端口提供保存的证书。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:464
msgid ""
"// operations.rst: HTTP-01 validation of one name (RFC 8555).\n"
"#import \"style.typ\": *\n"
"#show: figure-frame.with(lang: \"en\")\n"
"\n"
"#sequence(\n"
"  (\n"
"    actor(\"sibuna\", \"Sibuna\", kind: \"accent\"),\n"
"    actor(\"ca\", \"Certificate authority\", kind: \"party\"),\n"
"  ),\n"
"  (\n"
"    msg(\"sibuna\", \"ca\", \"Order `example.org`\"),\n"
