#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:464
msgid "HTTP-01 validation on port 80."
msgstr "在 80 端口验证 HTTP-01。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:467
msgid "So three things must hold before the first start."
msgstr "因此在首次启动之前，必须满足三个条件。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:469
msgid "Each name has a public DNS record that points at this host."
msgstr "每个名称都有一条指向这台主机的公共 DNS 记录。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:470
msgid ""
"Port 80 or port 443 of the host is reachable from the Internet. Port 80 "
"serves the HTTP-01 challenge and port 443 serves the TLS-ALPN-01 "
"challenge. One of the two is enough."
msgstr ""
"主机的端口 80 或端口 443 可以从互联网访问。端口 80 用于 HTTP-01 挑战，端口 443 用于 TLS-ALPN-01 "
"挑战。两者有一个即可。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:471
msgid "The daemon's user can write the storage directory."
msgstr "守护进程的用户可以写入存储目录。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:473
msgid ""
"The work happens on a thread of its own. A listener never waits for the "
"authority, and a failure never stops a listener. Until the first "
"certificate arrives, a handshake for the name receives the default "
"certificate of the listener, or fails when the listener has none. A new "
"certificate serves the next handshake. We send no SIGHUP and restart "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"这项工作在一个单独的线程上进行。监听器从不等待证书颁发机构，失败也从不让监听器停止。在第一个证书到达之前，针对该名称的握手会收到监听器的默认证书；如果监听器没有默认证书，握手就会失败。新证书从下一次握手开始提供。我们不发送 "
"SIGHUP，也不重启任何东西。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:475
msgid "Every option has a default. We change one in ``global.acme``."
msgstr "每个选项都有默认值。我们在 ``global.acme`` 中修改其中一个。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:477
