#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1430
msgid ""
"The redirect is decided before the firewall, so a cleartext request is "
"never challenged first. The route for ``/.well-known/acme-challenge/`` "
"above keeps certificate validation over port 80 working."
msgstr ""
"重定向在防火墙之前决定，因此明文请求从不会先被挑战。上面为 ``/.well-known/acme-challenge/`` 设置的路由让通过端口 "
"80 的证书验证继续工作。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1432
msgid ""
"``set`` replaces a field: every field of that name is dropped and ours is "
"added. ``remove`` drops a field. A value is fixed text of at most 1024 "
"printable characters. The checker refuses the names that frame a message, "
"such as ``Host``, ``Content-Length`` and ``Connection``, and on requests "
"the forwarding fields that Sibuna writes itself. A request field that we "
"set or remove is also dropped when the client spells it with ``_`` for "
"``-``."
msgstr ""
"``set`` 替换一个字段：丢弃所有该名称的字段，再加上我们的字段。\\ ``remove`` 丢弃一个字段。值是最多 1024 "
"个可打印字符的固定文本。检查器拒绝那些界定消息的名称，例如 ``Host``、``Content-Length`` 和 "
"``Connection``；对于请求，还拒绝 Sibuna 自己写入的转发字段。我们设置或删除的请求字段，在客户端用 ``_`` 代替 "
"``-`` 拼写时也会被丢弃。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1434
msgid ""
"The edits apply to exchanges with a server. Sibuna's own pages, such as a "
"challenge or a 502, do not carry them."
msgstr "这些修改作用于与服务器的交换。Sibuna 自己的页面（例如挑战页面或 502）不带这些修改。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1436
msgid ""
"In JSON the members have the same names: ``\"redirect_https\": true``, "
"``\"max_body\": \"10m\"``, ``\"sticky\": {\"kind\": \"cookie\", "
"\"cookie\": \"srv\"}``."
msgstr ""
"在 JSON 中，成员名称相同：``\"redirect_https\": true``、``\"max_body\": "
"\"10m\"``、``\"sticky\": {\"kind\": \"cookie\", \"cookie\": \"srv\"}``。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1440
msgid "WebSockets"
msgstr "WebSocket"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1443
msgid ""
"A WebSocket begins as an HTTP request, and Sibuna judges that request "
"like any other: bans, limits, the policy and the semantic firewall apply "
"to the handshake. The offer must be a well-formed version 13 handshake, "
"and the server's 101 must carry the matching accept key. "
"``Sec-WebSocket-Protocol`` and ``Sec-WebSocket-Extensions`` pass "
"unchanged, so subprotocols and compression are negotiated end to end. "
"After the 101 Sibuna relays bytes and does not parse frames. A tunnel "
"costs a record and two sockets, not a thread."
msgstr ""
"WebSocket 以一个 HTTP 请求开始，Sibuna "
"像对待其他请求一样评判它：封禁、限制、策略和语义防火墙都作用于握手。请求必须是格式正确的第 13 版握手，服务器的 101 "
"必须带有匹配的接受密钥。\\ ``Sec-WebSocket-Protocol`` 和 ``Sec-WebSocket-Extensions`` "
"原样通过，因此子协议和压缩在端到端之间协商。101 之后，Sibuna 中继字节，不解析帧。一个隧道的代价是一条记录和两个套接字，而不是一个线程。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1445
msgid ""
"A frontend or a route may carry a ``websocket`` object. A route without "
"one keeps the rule of its frontend."
msgstr "前端或路由可以带有 ``websocket`` 对象。没有该对象的路由保持其前端的规则。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1447
msgid ""
"{\"routes\": [{\"path_prefix\": \"/api/live\", \"backend\": \"app\",\n"
"             \"websocket\": {\"origins\": [\"https://app.example.org\"], "
"\"max_per_ip\": 16}}]}"
msgstr ""
"{\"routes\": [{\"path_prefix\": \"/api/live\", \"backend\": \"app\",\n"
"             \"websocket\": {\"origins\": [\"https://app.example.org\"], "
"\"max_per_ip\": 16}}]}"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1452
msgid "WebSocket rule"
msgstr "WebSocket 规则"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1458
msgid "``origins``"
msgstr "``origins``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1459
msgid ""
"The origins that may open a tunnel, each a scheme, a host and an optional "
"port. An upgrade whose ``Origin`` field is absent or not listed answers "
"403. A browser sends a site's cookies with a handshake from any page, so "
"an application that authenticates by cookie needs this check."
msgstr ""
"可以打开隧道的源，每项都是一个协议方案、一个主机和一个可选端口。\\ ``Origin`` 字段缺失或未列出的升级请求应答为 "
"403。浏览器在任何页面发起的握手中都会带上某个站点的 Cookie，因此通过 Cookie 认证的应用需要这项检查。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1460
msgid "``max_per_ip``"
msgstr "``max_per_ip``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1461
msgid ""
"The most concurrent tunnels of one client address under this rule. A "
"client over it answers 429. A reload starts the count again for new "
"tunnels."
msgstr "在这条规则下，一个客户端地址最多可以有的并发隧道数。超出的客户端应答为 429。重新加载后，新隧道重新开始计数。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1463
msgid ""
"Both checks apply whether or not the route uses the firewall. A browser "
"cannot solve a challenge inside a WebSocket handshake. If a policy "
"challenges the page, the page's session cookie admits the handshake. For "
"a client that is not a browser we allow the tunnel's path in the policy."
msgstr ""
"无论路由是否使用防火墙，这两项检查都适用。浏览器无法在 WebSocket 握手中解答挑战。如果策略对页面发起挑战，页面的会话 Cookie "
"会准入握手。对于不是浏览器的客户端，我们在策略中放行隧道的路径。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1465
msgid ""
"Three timers matter. ``websocket_idle_timeout`` closes a tunnel on which "
"neither side sent a byte for that long, so we set it above the "
"application's ping interval. ``idle_timeout`` bounds the handshake. A "
"shutdown closes tunnels after the drain period of five seconds, and "
"Sibuna sends no close frame, because it does not speak the framing. "
"Clients must reconnect, as they must after any network fault."
msgstr ""
"有三个计时器很重要。\\ ``websocket_idle_timeout`` "
"关闭双方在这么长时间内都没有发送任何字节的隧道，因此我们把它设为高于应用的 ping 间隔。\\ ``idle_timeout`` "
"限制握手。关闭时，隧道在五秒的排空期之后关闭，Sibuna 不发送关闭帧，因为它不理解帧格式。客户端必须重新连接，就像遇到任何网络故障之后一样。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1467
msgid ""
"A tunnel stays on the server that accepted it. An application that keeps "
"its live state in one process, such as a hub of connected clients, "
"therefore needs a pool with one server, or a broker behind its servers."
msgstr ""
"隧道停留在接受它的服务器上。因此，把实时状态保存在一个进程中的应用（例如一个连接客户端的中心），需要一个只有一台服务器的服务器池，或者在其服务器之后放一个消息代理。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1471
msgid "TCP inspection and PROXY v2"
msgstr "TCP 检查与 PROXY v2"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1474
msgid ""
"A frontend may set ``\"tcp_inspect\": \"tls_client_hello\"``, define "
"``acls`` with an ``sni`` name, exact or a wildcard such as "
"``*.example.org`` as in HTTP routes, an ``alpn`` match or a "
"``ja4_prefix`` pattern such as ``t13d*``, and list ordered ``deny`` or "
"``use_backend`` rules. A rule whose server name an earlier wildcard rule "
"already matches can never decide, and the file is refused. By default the "
"worker closes malformed or incomplete handshakes after a bounded "
"inspection of up to 32 KiB and a default deadline of two seconds, and "
"``inspect_fallback`` can forward them instead (see the next section). A "
"complete hello with no matching rule uses the default pool. Enable "
"``\"proxy_v2\": {\"enabled\": true}`` on a TCP pool only when its servers "
"accept a PROXY v2 address header before the stream. We can add "
"``\"tlv_sni\": true`` or ``\"tlv_ja4\": true`` inside ``proxy_v2`` to "
"forward inspected metadata. SNI uses the AUTHORITY type (0x02). Sibuna "
"uses the custom type 0xe0 for the 36 ASCII bytes of JA4. The origin must "
"agree on this type. The header names the client and the address it "
"reached. Two IPv4 addresses are written as IPv4, also when the listener "
"is dual-stack and the socket sees them as IPv4-mapped IPv6. Addresses of "
"different families are written as IPv6, with the IPv4 address mapped. The "
"health probes of such a pool begin with a version 2 header with the "
"``LOCAL`` command, which the protocol requires a server to accept, and "
"fail when the server closes the connection at once. Each such probe waits "
"up to 100 milliseconds for that refusal. The probes of all pools take "
"turns on four threads, so a node with hundreds of such servers checks "
"each one less often than its ``interval``. We check the pool's health "
"once after we enable ``proxy_v2``."
msgstr ""
"前端可以设置 ``\"tcp_inspect\": \"tls_client_hello\"``，定义 ``acls``，其中可以使用 ``sni`` 名称（精确名称，或像 HTTP 路由中那样使用 ``*.example.org`` 这样的通配符）、``alpn`` 匹配或 ``t13d*`` 这样的 ``ja4_prefix`` 模式，并列出有序的 ``deny`` 或 ``use_backend`` 规则。如果前面的通配符规则已经匹配某条规则的服务器名称，这条规则就永远无法作出决定，该文件会被拒绝。默认情况下，worker 在最多 32 KiB 的有界检查之后（默认期限为两秒）关闭格式错误或不完整的握手，而 ``inspect_fallback`` 可以改为转发它们（见下一节）。没有匹配规则的完整 hello 使用默认服务器池。只有当 TCP 服务器池的服务器在流之前接受 PROXY v2 地址头部时，才在该服务器池上启用 ``\"proxy_v2\": {\"enabled\": true}``。我们可以在 ``proxy_v2`` 中加上 ``\"tlv_sni\": true`` 或 ``\"tlv_ja4\": true``，以转发检查得到的元数据。SNI 使用 AUTHORITY 类型（0x02）。Sibuna 对 JA4 的 36 个 ASCII 字节使用自定义类型 0xe0。源站必须认同这个类型。该头部指明客户端及其到达的地址。两个 IPv4 地址写作 IPv4，即使监听器是双栈的、套接字把它们视为 IPv4 映射的 IPv6 地址也是如此。不同地址族的地址写作 IPv6，其中的 IPv4 地址经过映射。这种服务器池的健康探测以带 ``LOCAL`` 命令的版本 2 头部开头，协议要求服务器接受这种头部；服务器立即关闭连接时，探测失败。每个这样的探测最多等待 100 毫秒来确认这种拒绝。所有服务器池的探测在四个线程上轮流进行，因此一个有数百台这种服务器的节点检查每台服务器的频率会低于其 ``interval``。启用 ``proxy_v2`` 之后，我们检查一次该服务器池的健康状况。"

