#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1633
msgid ""
"**The order of the checks.** An accept thread runs the checks on each "
"connection, and the first that fails refuses it: the node drains, the "
"address is banned, the connection rate, the caps of the node, the "
"frontend and the address, and pressure. A refused connection costs one "
"accept and one reset. It reaches no hook, no inspection and no server. A "
"proxy in ``trusted_proxies`` carries many clients, so the bans, the rate, "
"the address cap and pressure do not apply to it. Behind "
"``proxy_protocol`` the client that the header names meets them instead."
msgstr ""
"**检查顺序。**\\ "
"接受线程对每个连接执行这些检查，第一个失败的检查拒绝该连接：节点排空、地址被封禁、连接速率、节点、前端和地址的上限，以及压力。被拒绝的连接只花费一次 "
"accept 和一次重置。它不会到达任何钩子、任何检查环节或任何服务器。``trusted_proxies`` "
"中的代理承载许多客户端，因此封禁、速率、地址上限和压力不适用于它。在 ``proxy_protocol`` "
"之后，改为由头部指明的客户端接受这些检查。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1635
msgid ""
"**Bans at accept.** The HTTP firewall and the packet worker share one ban "
"table. A ban that the firewall, the operator or a peer issued refuses the "
"address at accept on a ``tcp`` frontend and before a mapping opens on a "
"``udp`` frontend. An ``http`` frontend keeps answering a banned client "
"with its ban page, so a person who was banned by mistake learns why; "
"under pressure it refuses at accept instead, because then every accept "
"counts. ``auto_ban`` counts only refusals that need a completed TCP "
"handshake, so the address is real. The file refuses ``auto_ban`` on a "
"``udp`` frontend, because a spoofed datagram would ban the owner of the "
"address."
msgstr ""
"**接受时封禁。**\\ HTTP 防火墙和数据包 worker 共享一张封禁表。由防火墙、运维人员或对等节点发出的封禁，在 ``tcp`` "
"前端上于接受连接时拒绝该地址，在 ``udp`` 前端上于映射打开之前拒绝该地址。``http`` "
"前端仍以其封禁页面回应被封禁的客户端，让被误封的人知道原因；但在压力下，它改为在接受时拒绝，因为那时每一次 accept "
"都要计较。``auto_ban`` 只统计需要完成 TCP 握手的拒绝，因此地址是真实的。配置文件不允许在 ``udp`` 前端上使用 "
"``auto_ban``，因为伪造的数据报会让地址的真正所有者被封禁。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1637
msgid ""
"**Pressure mode.** Every 100 ms the node compares its flows with "
"``global.max_flows``. At ``on`` percent it switches pressure on, and at "
"``off`` percent it switches it off again; the gap keeps a steady load "
"from switching it back and forth. While it is on, a new address passes "
"only with a token from a bucket of ``new_per_second`` tokens a second, "
"and a known address passes as before. An address is known for a day after "
"one of its flows proved it: a TCP stream with bytes both ways, a UDP "
"mapping that got a reply, an HTTP/3 handshake after Retry, or an HTTP "
"request that a server answered with a status below 400. A challenge page "
"proves nobody. Each switch is one line:"
msgstr ""
"**压力模式。**\\ 节点每 100 ms 将其流数与 ``global.max_flows`` 比较一次。达到 ``on`` "
"百分比时开启压力模式，降到 ``off`` 百分比时再次关闭；两者之间的差距使稳定的负载不会让它来回切换。开启期间，新地址只有从每秒补充 "
"``new_per_second`` "
"个令牌的令牌桶中取得一个令牌才能通过，已知地址照常通过。地址的某条流证明了它之后，它在一天内是已知地址。能证明地址的流是：一条双向都有字节的 "
"TCP 流、一个收到回复的 UDP 映射、一次 Retry 之后的 HTTP/3 握手，或一个服务器以低于 400 的状态码应答的 HTTP "
"请求。挑战页面不能证明任何地址。每次切换记录一行："

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1639
msgid ""
"EDGE016: pressure mode is on: the flow table is nearly full, so new "
"client addresses are admitted at global.pressure.new_per_second and known "
"ones first\n"
"EDGE016: pressure mode is off: new client addresses pass again"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1644
msgid ""
"**Accept threads.** Each accept thread watches every TCP and HTTP "
"listener. On Linux one connection wakes one thread, so a flood of "
"connections is refused on several cores. An admitted connection goes with "
"its flow slot to the packet worker, which runs the hooks and chooses a "
"server as before. UDP stays on the packet worker. A drain and a handoff "
"to a replacement process wait until no accept thread watches the "
"listeners they give up."
msgstr ""
"**接受线程。**\\ 每个接受线程都监视所有 TCP 和 HTTP 监听器。在 Linux "
"上，一个连接只唤醒一个线程，因此连接洪泛会在多个核心上被拒绝。被准入的连接连同其流槽位交给数据包 "
"worker，由它像以前一样运行钩子并选择服务器。UDP 仍由数据包 worker "
"处理。排空以及向替换进程的移交，都要等到不再有接受线程监视它们要放弃的监听器为止。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1646
msgid ""
"**Confirmed UDP mappings.** A mapping is confirmed when QUIC validated "
"its client, or when the server answered and the client then sent again. A "
"flood from random addresses therefore never takes the last half of "
"``total_pps``. The second rule is weak: a sender that forges an address "
"can send twice without seeing the answer. A protocol with its own "
"validation, such as QUIC with ``\"udp_inspect\": \"quic\"``, should use "
"it."
msgstr ""
"**已确认的 UDP 映射。**\\ 当 QUIC "
"验证了映射的客户端，或者服务器已应答且客户端随后再次发送时，映射即为已确认。因此，来自随机地址的洪泛永远占不到 ``total_pps`` "
"的后一半。第二条规则较弱：伪造地址的发送方无需看到应答就能发送两次。自带验证的协议，例如使用 ``\"udp_inspect\": "
"\"quic\"`` 的 QUIC，应当使用这种验证。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1648
msgid ""
"**What we see.** Five reasons join ``sibuna_edge_refused_total``: "
"``banned``, ``pressure``, ``frontend_limit``, ``client_flow_limit`` and "
"``udp_total_limit``. ``sibuna_edge_pressure`` is 1 while pressure is on, "
"``sibuna_edge_pressure_switches_total`` counts the switches, and "
"``sibuna_edge_strikes_total`` and ``sibuna_edge_auto_bans_total`` count "
"the strikes and the bans they caused. The edge page of the console shows "
"the pressure state and the 16 addresses with the most refusals in the "
"current minute, with the cause of the last one. The metrics endpoint does "
"not name addresses, to keep its series bounded."
msgstr ""
"**我们能看到什么。**\\ ``sibuna_edge_refused_total`` "
"新增五种原因：``banned``、``pressure``、``frontend_limit``、``client_flow_limit`` 和 "
"``udp_total_limit``。压力模式开启时 ``sibuna_edge_pressure`` 为 "
"1，``sibuna_edge_pressure_switches_total`` "
"统计切换次数，``sibuna_edge_strikes_total`` 和 ``sibuna_edge_auto_bans_total`` "
"分别统计违规次数和由此导致的封禁。控制台的边缘页面显示压力状态，以及当前这一分钟内被拒绝次数最多的 16 "
"个地址，并给出每个地址最近一次被拒绝的原因。指标端点不列出地址，以使其序列数量有界。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1650
msgid ""
"**What no node can do.** A flood larger than the link, a SYN flood at "
"line rate and a reflection attack must be stopped before the node: by the "
"provider's scrubbing, by anycast or by filters in the routers. Clients "
"behind one carrier-grade NAT share an address, so ``max_flows_per_ip`` "
"and ``auto_ban`` treat them as one; set them per frontend with that in "
"mind."
msgstr ""
"**节点做不到的事。**\\ 超过链路容量的洪泛、线速的 SYN "
"洪泛和反射攻击，必须在节点之前拦截：靠提供商的流量清洗、任播或路由器中的过滤器。位于同一个运营商级 NAT 之后的客户端共享一个地址，因此 "
"``max_flows_per_ip`` 和 ``auto_ban`` 会把它们当作一个客户端；按前端设置这两项时，我们要考虑到这一点。"

