#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1957
msgid ""
"With this section, and with frontends that bind the same addresses on "
"every node, we edit the file on one node and run one command."
msgstr "有了这个部分，再加上在每个节点上绑定相同地址的前端，我们只需在一个节点上编辑文件并运行一条命令。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1959
