#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2165
msgid ""
"What the forwarding port refused: ``stranger``, ``bad_tag``, ``stale``, "
"``malformed``, ``unknown``. ``bad_tag`` means a node with another key "
"file. ``stranger`` means the port is reachable from outside the cluster."
msgstr ""
"转发端口拒绝的内容：\\ "
"``stranger``、``bad_tag``、``stale``、``malformed``、``unknown``。\\ "
"``bad_tag`` 表示某个节点使用了另一个密钥文件。\\ ``stranger`` 表示该端口可以从集群外部访问。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2167
msgid "Replacing the binary without closing the port"
msgstr "不关闭端口地替换二进制文件"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2170
msgid ""
"With ``global.reuse_port`` ``true`` we upgrade Sibuna, or change a "
"setting that needs a restart, without a moment in which the port is "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"当 ``global.reuse_port`` 为 ``true`` 时，我们可以升级 Sibuna，或修改需要重启的设置，而端口一刻也不会关闭。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2172
msgid ""
"/opt/sibuna/new/sibuna check -f /etc/sibuna/edge.jlv\n"
"/opt/sibuna/new/sibuna --config-file /etc/sibuna/edge.jlv &   # binds the "
"same addresses\n"
"kill -TERM \"$OLD_PID\"                                         # drains, "
"then stops"
msgstr ""
"/opt/sibuna/new/sibuna check -f /etc/sibuna/edge.jlv\n"
"/opt/sibuna/new/sibuna --config-file /etc/sibuna/edge.jlv &   # 绑定相同的地址\n"
"kill -TERM \"$OLD_PID\"                                         # 排空，然后停止"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2178
msgid ""
"The new process binds the same addresses while the old one serves, and "
"the kernel gives each new connection to one of them. On SIGTERM the old "
"process stops accepting and waits up to ``shutdown_timeout`` for its "
"established flows. The new process takes the admin socket when it starts, "
"and the old process leaves that socket alone when it stops."
msgstr ""
"新进程在旧进程提供服务的同时绑定相同的地址，内核把每个新连接交给两者之一。收到 SIGTERM 时，旧进程停止接受连接，并最多等待 "
"``shutdown_timeout`` 让已建立的流结束。新进程在启动时接管管理套接字，旧进程在停止时不会动这个套接字。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2180
msgid ""
"A takeover needs no ``global.drain_delay``: nothing in front has to "
"notice, because the new process already accepts. With a delay the old "
"process keeps accepting its share of new connections for that time, and "
"only then stops. We set a delay for the other case, a node that leaves "
"the pool of a balancer in front."
msgstr ""
"接管不需要 "
"``global.drain_delay``：前面的任何东西都不需要察觉，因为新进程已经在接受连接。设置了延迟时，旧进程会在这段时间内继续接受它那一份新连接，之后才停止。我们为另一种情况设置延迟：节点离开前面负载均衡器的服务器池。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2182
msgid ""
"An HTTP/3 client may need to reconnect if the kernel sends its packets to "
"a process that lacks its QUIC connection state. Without ``reuse_port``, "
"the second process cannot bind the same address."
msgstr ""
"如果内核将数据包交给没有相应 QUIC 连接状态的进程，HTTP/3 客户端可能需要重新连接。未启用 ``reuse_port`` "
"时，第二个进程无法绑定同一地址。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2186
msgid "Replacing the binary without losing a connection"
msgstr "不丢失连接地替换二进制文件"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2189
msgid ""
"With ``global.reuse_port`` each process has its own TCP accept queue. The "
"old process closes its TCP listeners when the drain begins. Established "
"streams can finish while the replacement accepts new connections. A "
"connection still queued on the old listener can reset. The replacement "
"starts with an empty UDP mapping table."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``global.reuse_port`` 时，每个进程都有自己的 TCP 连接接受队列。旧进程在开始排空时关闭 TCP "
"监听套接字。新进程接受新连接时，已建立的流仍可完成传输。仍在旧队列中的连接可能被重置。新进程从空的 UDP 映射表开始。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2191
msgid ""
"With ``global.upgrade_socket`` the old process gives its listening "
"sockets to the new one. There is one accept queue, and it is never "
"closed. The old process also gives its UDP mappings, so a UDP client "
"keeps its server, and the server sees the same source address. The key "
"needs Linux."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``global.upgrade_socket`` "
"时，旧进程把它的监听套接字交给新进程。只有一个接受队列，并且它从不关闭。旧进程还会交出它的 UDP 映射，因此 UDP "
"客户端保留它的服务器，服务器看到的源地址也相同。这个键需要 Linux。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2193
msgid ""
"global: {\n"
"    upgrade_socket: \"/run/sibuna/edge.upgrade\",\n"
"},"
msgstr ""
"global: {\n"
"    upgrade_socket: \"/run/sibuna/edge.upgrade\",\n"
"},"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2199
msgid ""
"/opt/sibuna/new/sibuna check -f /etc/sibuna/edge.jlv\n"
"/opt/sibuna/new/sibuna --config-file /etc/sibuna/edge.jlv    # replaces "
"the running daemon"
msgstr ""
"/opt/sibuna/new/sibuna check -f /etc/sibuna/edge.jlv\n"
"/opt/sibuna/new/sibuna --config-file /etc/sibuna/edge.jlv    # 替换正在运行的守护进程"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2204
msgid ""
"The command of an upgrade is the command of a start. A process that "
"starts with this key connects to the path. When a daemon answers there, "
"the new process takes its place. When nobody answers, it starts as a "
"first process does. We do not signal the old process. It exits by itself "
"with status 0 when its established flows have ended, or after "
"``shutdown_timeout``."
msgstr ""
"升级的命令就是启动的命令。带有这个键启动的进程会连接该路径。如果那里有守护进程应答，新进程就接替它的位置。如果没有人应答，它就像第一个进程那样启动。我们不向旧进程发送信号。它在已建立的流结束后，或在 "
"``shutdown_timeout`` 之后，以状态 0 自行退出。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2207
msgid ""
"The old process pauses UDP at READY and passes the mappings. The "
"replacement adopts them and accepts TCP before DONE. It then reads UDP "
"while the old process drains."
msgstr ""
"在 READY 时旧进程暂停读取 UDP 并移交映射。新进程接管映射，在 DONE 前开始接受 TCP，随后读取 UDP，旧进程则处理完现有连接。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2207
msgid ""
"// cluster.rst and operations.rst: the listener handoff of SID 0029.\n"
"#import \"style.typ\": *\n"
"#show: figure-frame.with(lang: \"en\")\n"
"\n"
"#sequence(\n"
"  (\n"
"    actor(\"old\", \"Old process\"),\n"
"    actor(\"new\", \"Replacement\", kind: \"accent\"),\n"
"  ),\n"
"  (\n"
"    msg(\"new\", \"old\", \"`HELLO`\"),\n"
"    msg(\"old\", \"new\", \"`LISTENERS` with `SCM_RIGHTS`\"),\n"
"    msg(\"new\", \"old\", \"`READY`\", accent: true, note: \"Nobody reads "
"UDP; the kernel holds the datagrams\"),\n"
"    act(\"old\", \"Pause UDP, keep accepting TCP\"),\n"
"    msg(\"old\", \"new\", \"`FLOWS`, then `COMMIT`\"),\n"
"    act(\"new\", \"Adopt the mappings, accept TCP\"),\n"
"    msg(\"new\", \"old\", \"`DONE`\", accent: true),\n"
"    act(\"new\", \"Read UDP\", accent: true),\n"
"    act(\"old\", \"Drain TCP, exit\"),\n"
"  ),\n"
"  spacing: 60,\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""
"// cluster.rst and operations.rst: the listener handoff of SID 0029.\n"
"#import \"style.typ\": *\n"
"#show: figure-frame.with(lang: \"zh_CN\")\n"
"\n"
"#sequence(\n"
"  (\n"
"    actor(\"old\", \"旧进程\"),\n"
"    actor(\"new\", \"新进程\", kind: \"accent\"),\n"
"  ),\n"
"  (\n"
"    msg(\"new\", \"old\", \"`HELLO`\"),\n"
"    msg(\"old\", \"new\", \"`LISTENERS`，经 `SCM_RIGHTS`\"),\n"
"    msg(\"new\", \"old\", \"`READY`\", accent: true, note: \"无人读取 "
"UDP；内核暂存数据报\"),\n"
"    act(\"old\", \"暂停 UDP，继续接受 TCP\"),\n"
"    msg(\"old\", \"new\", \"`FLOWS`，然后 `COMMIT`\"),\n"
"    act(\"new\", \"接管映射，接受 TCP\"),\n"
"    msg(\"new\", \"old\", \"`DONE`\", accent: true),\n"
"    act(\"new\", \"读取 UDP\", accent: true),\n"
"    act(\"old\", \"排空 TCP，退出\"),\n"
"  ),\n"
"  spacing: 60,\n"
")\n"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2207
msgid "Listener handoff on Linux."
msgstr "Linux 上的监听套接字移交。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2210
msgid ""
"A new process that fails leaves the old one serving. This holds for a "
"file that does not check, for a certificate or a log file that cannot be "
"opened, and for a process that dies or hangs before it acknowledges. The "
"old process waits 10 s for the acknowledgement, then ends the new process "
"with SIGKILL and reads UDP again. Datagrams that arrived meanwhile waited "
"in the socket."
msgstr ""
"失败的新进程会让旧进程继续提供服务。对于未通过检查的文件、无法打开的证书或日志文件，以及在确认之前死掉或挂起的进程，都是如此。旧进程等待确认 10 "
"s，然后用 SIGKILL 结束新进程，并重新开始读取 UDP。在此期间到达的数据报在套接字中等待。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2216
msgid "Line"
msgstr "日志行"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2218
msgid "``UPG010``"
msgstr "``UPG010``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2219
msgid ""
"The old process handed over. The line gives the listeners, the UDP "
"mappings, the mappings that the new process dropped, and for how long UDP "
"was unread."
msgstr "旧进程完成了交接。这一行给出监听器、UDP 映射、新进程丢弃的映射，以及 UDP 未被读取的时长。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2220
msgid "``UPG011``"
msgstr "``UPG011``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2221
msgid "A replacement failed before the cutover. The old process serves on."
msgstr "替换在切换之前失败。旧进程继续提供服务。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2222
msgid "``UPG012``"
msgstr "``UPG012``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2223
msgid ""
"A peer was refused: another user, another version, or not a Sibuna edge."
msgstr "一个对端被拒绝：其他用户、其他版本，或者不是 Sibuna 边缘。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2224
msgid "``UPG013``"
msgstr "``UPG013``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2225
msgid ""
"A replacement hangs and cannot be ended. UDP stays unread until we end it "
"by hand."
msgstr "替换挂起且无法结束。在我们手动结束它之前，UDP 一直不会被读取。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2226
msgid "``UPG020``"
msgstr "``UPG020``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2227
msgid ""
"The new process took over. The line gives the listeners and mappings it "
"took."
msgstr "新进程完成了接管。这一行给出它接管的监听器和映射。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2229
msgid ""
"The new process prints a diagnostic with a code from ``UPG001`` to "
"``UPG008`` when it is refused, and exits with status 1."
msgstr "新进程被拒绝时，会打印一条代码为 ``UPG001`` 到 ``UPG008`` 的诊断信息，并以状态 1 退出。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2231
msgid "What survives:"
msgstr "什么能保留下来："

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2233
msgid ""
"A connection that waits in a TCP listener, and every new connection. In "
"our test, 17,000 to 33,000 connections during an upgrade, none failed."
msgstr "在 TCP 监听器中等待的连接，以及每个新连接。在我们的测试中，升级期间有 17,000 到 33,000 个连接，没有一个失败。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2234
msgid ""
"An established TCP stream or HTTP connection stays with the old process "
"until it ends, or until ``shutdown_timeout``."
msgstr "已建立的 TCP 流或 HTTP 连接留在旧进程中，直到它结束，或者直到 ``shutdown_timeout``。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2235
msgid ""
"A UDP mapping, when the new file has the same listener and the same "
"server. In our test 6,000 mappings moved, and UDP was unread for 59 to 87 "
"ms. With 41 mappings it was 1 ms."
msgstr ""
"UDP 映射，前提是新文件中有相同的监听器和相同的服务器。在我们的测试中，有 6,000 个映射被转移，UDP 有 59 到 87 ms "
"未被读取。只有 41 个映射时为 1 ms。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2237
msgid "What does not survive:"
msgstr "什么不能保留下来："

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2239
msgid "An HTTP/3 connection. The client connects again."
msgstr "HTTP/3 连接。客户端会重新连接。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2240
msgid ""
"Run-time commands such as a drained server, rate counters, health states "
"and sticky tables. The new process starts from its file. We repeat the "
"commands, or write them in the file first."
msgstr "运行时命令的效果，例如被排空的服务器、速率计数器、健康状态和会话保持表。新进程从它的文件开始。我们重复这些命令，或者先把它们写进文件。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2241
msgid ""
"A UDP mapping whose listener or server the new file no longer has, or for "
"which the new process has no room. Its client is given a server by its "
"next datagram."
msgstr "新文件中已不再有其监听器或服务器的 UDP 映射，或者新进程没有空间容纳的映射。其客户端会在下一个数据报到来时被分配服务器。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2243
msgid ""
"Both processes must run as the same user. The socket file has mode 0600, "
"and each end checks the user of the other. Each daemon needs a path of "
"its own: a new process that finds a daemon with other addresses at the "
"path gives up with ``UPG008``. A start with this key replaces a running "
"daemon, so starting the service twice no longer fails with ADDRESS IN USE."
msgstr ""
"两个进程必须以同一个用户运行。套接字文件的权限为 "
"0600，每一端都会检查另一端的用户。每个守护进程都需要自己的路径：在该路径上发现一个地址不同的守护进程的新进程会以 ``UPG008`` "
"放弃。带有这个键的启动会替换正在运行的守护进程，因此把服务启动两次不再会因 ADDRESS IN USE 而失败。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2245
msgid ""
"The new process holds a descriptor for every mapping it takes, beside "
"those of the old process, so ``LimitNOFILE`` must allow for both."
msgstr "新进程为它接管的每个映射持有一个描述符，与旧进程的描述符并存，因此 ``LimitNOFILE`` 必须同时容纳两者。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2247
msgid ""
"A node with a mesh, with ``accept_config`` or with a separate "
"``observability.listen`` cannot be replaced this way yet: those sockets "
"are not passed. We use ``reuse_port`` or a restart there."
msgstr ""
"带有网格、带有 ``accept_config`` 或带有单独 ``observability.listen`` "
"的节点，目前还不能用这种方式替换：那些套接字不会被传递。在这些情况下，我们使用 ``reuse_port`` 或重启。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2249
msgid ""
"Under systemd the two processes are two instances of a template unit. The "
"directory of the sockets must outlive an instance, so it is not a "
"``RuntimeDirectory`` of the unit."
msgstr ""
"在 systemd 下，两个进程是一个模板单元的两个实例。套接字所在的目录必须比实例存活得更久，因此它不是该单元的 "
"``RuntimeDirectory``。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2251
msgid ""
"# /etc/systemd/system/sibuna-edge@.service\n"
"[Unit]\n"
"Description=Sibuna edge (%i)\n"
"\n"
"[Service]\n"
"User=sibuna\n"
"ExecStart=/opt/sibuna/%i/sibuna --config-file /etc/sibuna/edge.jlv\n"
"Restart=on-failure\n"
"LimitNOFILE=1048576"
msgstr ""
"# /etc/systemd/system/sibuna-edge@.service\n"
"[Unit]\n"
"Description=Sibuna edge (%i)\n"
"\n"
"[Service]\n"
"User=sibuna\n"
"ExecStart=/opt/sibuna/%i/sibuna --config-file /etc/sibuna/edge.jlv\n"
"Restart=on-failure\n"
"LimitNOFILE=1048576"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2263
msgid ""
"systemctl start sibuna-edge@b     # replaces sibuna-edge@a, which exits "
"with status 0"
msgstr "systemctl start sibuna-edge@b     # 替换 sibuna-edge@a，后者以状态 0 退出"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2267
msgid ""
"``Restart=always`` must not be used: the old instance would start again "
"and take the listeners back. With ``Restart=on-failure`` a new instance "
"that crashes after the cutover is started again, and binds as a first "
"process does. We have not run this unit under systemd. The exit statuses "
"it relies on are tested."
msgstr ""
"不能使用 ``Restart=always``：旧实例会再次启动并夺回监听器。使用 ``Restart=on-failure`` "
"时，在切换后崩溃的新实例会被再次启动，并像第一个进程那样绑定。我们尚未在 systemd 下运行过这个单元。它所依赖的退出状态已经过测试。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2269
msgid "Changing servers at run time"
msgstr "运行时变更服务器"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2272
msgid ""
"A deployment takes one server out of rotation, replaces it, and returns "
"it. For this we need no edit of the file. The daemon opens a local admin "
"socket when the file names one, and ``sibuna ctl`` sends it one command."
msgstr ""
"一次部署会让一台服务器退出轮转、替换它，然后让它恢复。为此我们不需要编辑文件。文件指定了本地管理套接字时，守护进程会打开它，``sibuna "
"ctl`` 向它发送一条命令。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2274
msgid ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return {\n"
"        global: { admin_socket: \"/run/sibuna/edge.sock\" },\n"
"        frontends: { web: { binds: [\"0.0.0.0:8080\"] } },\n"
"        backends: { app: { servers: [\"10.0.0.1:80\", \"10.0.0.2:80\"] } "
"},\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return {\n"
"        global: { admin_socket: \"/run/sibuna/edge.sock\" },\n"
"        frontends: { web: { binds: [\"0.0.0.0:8080\"] } },\n"
"        backends: { app: { servers: [\"10.0.0.1:80\", \"10.0.0.2:80\"] } "
"},\n"
"    }\n"
"}"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2284
msgid ""
"$ sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock set server app/10.0.0.1:80 state "
"drain\n"
"$ sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock add server app/blue 10.0.0.3:80 weight "
"2\n"
"$ sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show servers\n"
"pool name        address     state weight flows health ejected ramp "
"changed\n"
"app  10.0.0.1:80 10.0.0.1:80 drain 1      4     -      -       -    "
"state\n"
"app  10.0.0.2:80 10.0.0.2:80 ready 1      9     -      7s      -    -\n"
"app  blue        10.0.0.3:80 ready 2      0     -      -       40%  added"
msgstr ""
"$ sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock set server app/10.0.0.1:80 state "
"drain\n"
"$ sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock add server app/blue 10.0.0.3:80 weight "
"2\n"
"$ sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show servers\n"
"pool name        address     state weight flows health ejected ramp "
"changed\n"
"app  10.0.0.1:80 10.0.0.1:80 drain 1      4     -      -       -    "
"state\n"
"app  10.0.0.2:80 10.0.0.2:80 ready 1      9     -      7s      -    -\n"
"app  blue        10.0.0.3:80 ready 2      0     -      -       40%  added"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2294
msgid "Commands of ``sibuna ctl SOCKET``"
msgstr "``sibuna ctl SOCKET`` 的命令"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2298
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2300
msgid "``show servers``"
msgstr "``show servers``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2301
msgid ""
"One line per server. ``ejected`` is the time passive health still keeps "
"the server out, and ``ramp`` is the share of its weight that a server in "
"slow start has now. The column ``changed`` holds ``-`` for a server that "
"is served as the file describes it, ``added`` for one that a command "
"added, and ``state`` or ``weight`` for a changed field."
msgstr ""
"每台服务器一行。\\ ``ejected`` 是被动健康检查仍让该服务器保持在外的时间，``ramp`` "
"是处于慢启动中的服务器当前拥有的权重比例。对于按文件描述提供服务的服务器，``changed`` 列为 ``-``；对于由命令添加的服务器为 "
"``added``；对于字段被修改的服务器为 ``state`` 或 ``weight``。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2302
msgid "``show stats``"
msgstr "``show stats``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2303
msgid ""
"The series of the edge in the Prometheus text format: requests, bytes and "
"times per frontend and per server, client aborts per server, refusals by "
"reason, the flow table, the access log and its queue, the flow lines that "
"were dropped, and the PROXY protocol. It prints the same series as the "
"metrics route."
msgstr ""
"Prometheus "
"文本格式的边缘序列：每个前端和每台服务器的请求数、字节数和时间，每台服务器的客户端中止数，按原因统计的拒绝数，流表，访问日志及其队列，被丢弃的流日志行，以及 "
"PROXY 协议。它打印的序列与指标路由相同。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2304
msgid "``reopen log``"
msgstr "``reopen log``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2305
msgid ""
"Opens the access log file again, after a rotation renamed it. It reloads "
"nothing."
msgstr "在轮转重命名访问日志文件之后，重新打开它。它不重新加载任何东西。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2306
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2774
msgid "``show certs``"
msgstr "``show certs``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2307
msgid ""
"One line per name of automatic HTTPS: how it is obtained, the issuer, the "
"expiry, the next renewal, the state and the last failure (section "
"*Automatic HTTPS*)."
msgstr "自动 HTTPS 的每个名称一行：获取方式、签发者、过期时间、下一次续期、状态和最近一次失败（见 *自动 HTTPS*\\ 一节）。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2308
msgid "``show ca``"
msgstr "``show ca``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2309
msgid ""
"The root certificate of the local authority as PEM, with its file and its "
"expiry in comment lines. We install it in the clients of internal names."
msgstr "以 PEM 格式输出本地证书颁发机构的根证书，并在注释行中给出它的文件和过期时间。我们把它安装到使用内部名称的客户端上。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2310
msgid "``revoke cert NAME|SERIAL``"
msgstr "``revoke cert NAME|SERIAL``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2311
msgid ""
"Revokes a certificate of the local authority, writes the revocation list "
"and replaces the certificate (section *Automatic HTTPS*)."
msgstr "吊销本地证书颁发机构的一个证书，写出吊销列表，并替换该证书（见 *自动 HTTPS*\\ 一节）。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2312
msgid "``show info``"
msgstr "``show info``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2313
msgid ""
"The version, the process, the file, the number of reloads, the watcher, "
"the flows, the drops, the number of run-time changes, and the servers of "
"the file that a command removed."
msgstr "版本、进程、文件、重新加载次数、监视器、流、丢弃数、运行时修改的数量，以及文件中被命令删除的服务器。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2314
msgid "``set server POOL/NAME state ready|drain``"
msgstr "``set server POOL/NAME state ready|drain``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2315
msgid ""
"``drain`` stops new flows to the server. Its health probes continue. "
"``ready`` admits it again. ``maint`` is accepted as another word for "
"``drain``."
msgstr ""
"``drain`` 停止向该服务器发送新的流。它的健康探测继续进行。\\ ``ready`` 再次准入它。\\ ``maint`` 被接受为 "
"``drain`` 的另一种写法。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2316
msgid "``set server POOL/NAME weight N``"
msgstr "``set server POOL/NAME weight N``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2317
msgid "Sets the weight, 1 to 65,535."
msgstr "设置权重，1 到 65,535。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2318
msgid "``add server POOL/NAME IP:PORT [weight N]``"
msgstr "``add server POOL/NAME IP:PORT [weight N]``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2319
msgid ""
"Adds a server. It takes the health check of its pool and starts in "
"service. The name has 1 to 64 letters, digits and ``. _ : [ ] -``."
msgstr ""
"添加一台服务器。它采用其服务器池的健康检查，并以服务状态启动。名称由 1 到 64 个字母、数字和 ``. _ : [ ] -`` 组成。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2320
msgid "``del server POOL/NAME``"
msgstr "``del server POOL/NAME``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2321
msgid ""
"Removes a server. The last server of a pool stays. We drain it instead."
msgstr "删除一台服务器。服务器池的最后一台服务器会保留。我们改为排空它。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2322
msgid "``reload``"
msgstr "``reload``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2323
msgid ""
"Loads the file and applies it, as SIGHUP does, and prints the result or "
"the reason for which the file was rejected."
msgstr "像 SIGHUP 那样加载并应用文件，并打印结果或文件被拒绝的原因。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2324
msgid "``show hooks``"
msgstr "``show hooks``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2325
msgid ""
"The plugins with their calls, verdicts, failures and open breakers "
"(section *Hooks*)."
msgstr "插件及其调用次数、判定、失败次数和处于断开状态的熔断器（见 *钩子*\\ 一节）。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2326
#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2784
msgid "``show affinity``"
msgstr "``show affinity``"

