#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2564
msgid ""
"We sign in, replace the temporary password, and open the page *Edge*. The "
"page shows four things."
msgstr "我们登录，更换临时密码，然后打开 *Edge* 页面。该页面显示四样东西。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2566
msgid ""
"**The node.** Its state is one of three words. *Serving* means that the "
"node admits new flows. *Draining* means that the node was told to stop: "
"it refuses new flows and finishes the open ones. *Full* means that the "
"flow table holds ``global.max_flows`` flows: the node refuses new flows "
"for lack of capacity. The table below the state gives the active flows "
"and the limit, the drops, the servers that are drained or down, the "
"reloads, the routing regime of the mesh and two revisions. The first "
"revision is the digest of the file, the one that ``show cluster`` prints. "
"The second is the revision of the database that the node serves in "
"persistent mode (SID 0028). A node that serves a file has none, and the "
"page says \"Not reported\"."
msgstr ""
"**节点。**\\ 它的状态是三个词之一。\\ *Serving* 表示节点准入新的流。\\ *Draining* "
"表示节点已被告知停止：它拒绝新的流，并完成已打开的流。\\ *Full* 表示流表中已有 ``global.max_flows`` "
"个流：节点因容量不足而拒绝新的流。状态下方的表格给出活动流数和上限、丢弃数、被排空或宕机的服务器、重新加载次数、网格的路由模式以及两个修订版本。第一个修订版本是文件的摘要，即 "
"``show cluster`` 打印的那个。第二个是节点在持久模式下提供的数据库修订版本（SID "
"0028）。提供文件的节点没有第二个修订版本，页面上显示 \"Not reported\"。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2568
msgid ""
"The Edge page showing a serving node, its flow limit and a table of "
"refusal causes."
msgstr "Edge 页面显示服务节点、流数上限和拒绝原因表。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2571
msgid ""
"We check whether the node admits new flows at (1). If clients are "
"refused, we read the counters by cause at (2)."
msgstr "我们在 (1) 检查节点是否接受新流。若客户端被拒绝，可以在 (2) 按原因查看计数。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2573
msgid ""
"**The refusals by cause.** One row for each reason of the metrics: "
"``flow_limit``, ``draining``, ``rate_limit``, ``connection_limit``, "
"``task_limit`` and the others. A node that refuses for lack of capacity "
"counts under ``flow_limit``, and a node that drains counts under "
"``draining``."
msgstr ""
"**按原因统计的拒绝。**\\ 指标的每个原因一行：\\ "
"``flow_limit``、``draining``、``rate_limit``、``connection_limit``、``task_limit`` "
"等等。因容量不足而拒绝的节点计入 ``flow_limit``，正在排空的节点计入 ``draining``。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2575
msgid ""
"The Edge console shows refusals at the per-client flow limit and lists "
"the loopback client with the most refusals this minute."
msgstr "Edge 控制台显示因单个客户端达到流数上限而拒绝的连接，以及当前这一分钟被拒绝次数最多的回环地址。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2578
msgid ""
"At (1) we read the cumulative refusals for the per-client flow limit. At "
"(2) we see which addresses were refused this minute and the last cause "
"for each."
msgstr ""
"在 (1) 处可以读到因每客户端流数上限而拒绝的累计次数。在 (2) 处可以看到当前这一分钟被拒绝的地址及每个地址最近一次被拒绝的原因。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2580
msgid ""
"**The frontends and the pools.** A frontend shows its requests, flows, "
"bytes and the latency of a request: the mean and the 95th percentile. A "
"pool shows the columns of ``show servers`` for each server, then its "
"requests, failures, requests in flight and the wait for the first byte. A "
"view carries at most 256 servers, and the page says how many it left out."
msgstr ""
"**前端与服务器池。**\\ 前端显示它的请求数、流数、字节数以及请求的延迟：平均值和第 95 百分位数。服务器池为每台服务器显示 ``show "
"servers`` 的各列，然后是它的请求数、失败数、进行中的请求数以及等待第一个字节的时间。一个视图最多显示 256 "
"台服务器，页面会说明省略了多少台。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2582
msgid ""
"The web frontend and timetable pool above the server controls on the Edge "
"page."
msgstr "Edge 页面的服务器控件上方显示 Web 前端和时刻表池。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2585
msgid ""
"We read the traffic reaching the web frontend at (1). At (2) we compare "
"the timetable replicas by weight, requests, failures and time to first "
"byte."
msgstr "我们在 (1) 查看到达 Web 前端的流量。在 (2) 比较时刻表各副本的权重、请求数、失败数和首字节耗时。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2587
msgid ""
"**The fleet.** One row for each member: the state of the link, the state "
"of the node, its flows, its servers and its two revisions. A member whose "
"file differs from the file of this node is marked ``differs``. A member "
"that does not answer in five seconds has the row ``No answer``."
msgstr ""
"**集群。**\\ 每个成员一行：链路的状态、节点的状态、它的流、它的服务器以及它的两个修订版本。文件与本节点文件不同的成员会被标记为 "
"``differs``。五秒内没有应答的成员，其行显示 ``No answer``。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2589
msgid ""
"An operator or an administrator also sees the commands. Each command is "
"one line of the admin socket, and the function of the admin socket runs "
"it. The same parser checks it, the same worker applies it, and the same "
"limit of 20 commands in a burst and 10 per second holds. A change reaches "
"the other nodes over the mesh, as it does from ``sibuna ctl``, unless we "
"tick *This node only*."
msgstr ""
"运维人员或管理员还能看到命令。每条命令都是管理套接字的一行，由管理套接字的功能来执行。同一个解析器检查它，同一个 worker 应用它，同样适用 "
"20 条命令突发、之后每秒 10 条的限制。与 ``sibuna ctl`` 一样，修改会通过网格到达其他节点，除非我们勾选 *This node "
"only*。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2595
msgid "The console offers"
msgstr "控制台提供"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2596
msgid "It does not offer"
msgstr "它不提供"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2597
msgid ""
"``set server POOL/NAME state ready|drain [local]``, ``set server "
"POOL/NAME weight N [local]``, ``add server``, ``del server``, ``del "
"ban``, ``reload cluster``, ``show servers``, ``show cluster``, ``show "
"certs``, ``show ca``"
msgstr ""
"``set server POOL/NAME state ready|drain [local]``, ``set server "
"POOL/NAME weight N [local]``, ``add server``, ``del server``, ``del "
"ban``, ``reload cluster``, ``show servers``, ``show cluster``, ``show "
"certs``, ``show ca``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2598
msgid ""
"``reload``, ``reopen log``, ``show info``, ``show stats``, ``show "
"authority``, ``show affinity``, ``revoke cert`` and every other command. "
"They stay on the host, with ``sibuna ctl``."
msgstr ""
"``reload``、``reopen log``、``show info``、``show stats``、``show "
"authority``、``show affinity``、``revoke cert`` 以及其他所有命令。它们留在主机上，通过 "
"``sibuna ctl`` 使用。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2600
msgid ""
"Every request passes the checks of the console: the session, the role, "
"the ``Origin`` field, the CSRF token and the allowance of the session. A "
"viewer reads the page and changes nothing. The audit log records each "
"change twice: the line before it runs, and the result after. A line that "
"the console does not offer is answered ``CONSOLEEDGE``, and the edge "
"never sees it."
msgstr ""
"每个请求都要通过控制台的检查：会话、角色、``Origin`` 字段、CSRF "
"令牌以及会话的配额。查看者只能阅读页面，不能修改任何东西。审计日志为每次修改记录两次：执行前记录命令行，执行后记录结果。控制台不提供的命令行会得到 "
"``CONSOLEEDGE`` 应答，边缘根本看不到它。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2602
msgid ""
"**A fleet.** For more than one node we write the list of all members, the "
"same on every node, so that ``reload cluster`` can carry the file. Each "
"node finds itself by its number, which a small file on the node holds."
msgstr ""
"**集群。**\\ 对于多个节点，我们写出所有成员的列表，在每个节点上都相同，以便 ``reload cluster`` "
"能传送该文件。每个节点通过自己的编号找到自己，编号保存在该节点上的一个小文件中。"

