#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2688
msgid ""
"The names carry no firewall here, because their clients are Git, curl and "
"runners. To protect the browser pages of a project, we give its route "
"``\"firewall\": true`` and exempt the API paths with earlier routes. Each "
"application sets its public URL to the HTTPS name. jlavi lists the Sibuna "
"node in ``trusted_proxies``. A runner key that pins the certificate's "
"public key stays valid as long as we keep the same private key when we "
"renew."
msgstr ""
"这里这些名称都不使用防火墙，因为它们的客户端是 Git、curl 和运行器。要保护某个项目的浏览器页面，我们给它的路由设置 "
"``\"firewall\": true``，并用更靠前的路由豁免 API 路径。每个应用都把它的公共 URL 设为 HTTPS 名称。jlavi "
"在 ``trusted_proxies`` 中列出 Sibuna 节点。只要续期时保留同一个私钥，固定了证书公钥的运行器密钥就一直有效。"

